<title>USA: Food Lion finanical chief resigns.</title>
<headline>Food Lion finanical chief resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SALISBURY, N.C. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food Lion Inc said on Friday that Chief Financial Officer Dan Boone left the company effective August 26.</p>
<p>Boone worked for Food Lion for 14 years, serving for the past six years as CFO. He was a director from 1991-94.</p>
<p>Until a successor is named, the company's finance department will report directly to Bill McCanless, senior vice president of administration and chief administrative officer, the supermarket chain said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
